html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§3.4, pp. 68–71; scans 76–79"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5dbd0808feb9e49\" href=\"?note=f5dbd0808feb9e49\" title=\"73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability\">73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in Q,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p,q\\in Q,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}table\\text{-}filling\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n(p,q)\\in D^M_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[|w|\\le n\\land\\bigl((\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\in F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\notin F)\\lor(\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\notin F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\in F)\\bigr)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}table\\text{-}filling\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n(p,q)\\in D^M_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[|w|\\le n\\land\\bigl((\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\in F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\notin F)\\lor(\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\notin F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\in F)\\bigr)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}table\\text{-}filling\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nD^M_{|Q|^2}=D^M_{|Q|^2+1}=\\{(p,q)\\in Q^2:\\operatorname{Dist}_M(p,q)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}table\\text{-}filling\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nD^M_{|Q|^2}=D^M_{|Q|^2+1}=\\{(p,q)\\in Q^2:\\operatorname{Dist}_M(p,q)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式按 n 归纳。递增链每次真增长至少加入 Q² 的一个新元素；一旦某阶段不增长就永久稳定，故最多 |Q|² 次增长。稳定点的补关系对每个字符转移保持，且不会把终态与非终态合并，从而给出第二式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability","status":"resolved","id":"f5dbd0808feb9e49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability","status":"resolved","id":"f5dbd0808feb9e49","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability]] 的 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$，$p,q\\in Q,n\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in Q,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}table\\text{-}filling\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n(p,q)\\in D^M_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[|w|\\le n\\land\\bigl((\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\in F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\notin F)\\lor(\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\notin F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\in F)\\bigr)\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}table\\text{-}filling\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nD^M_{|Q|^2}=D^M_{|Q|^2+1}=\\{(p,q)\\in Q^2:\\operatorname{Dist}_M(p,q)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1821,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-64","lo